WEBVTT

00:00:01.060 --> 00:00:05.060
<i>Café White Christmas</i>

00:00:03.460 --> 00:00:04.330
Gift.

00:00:05.060 --> 00:00:08.830
The magical power capable of granting any wish.

00:00:09.920 --> 00:00:11.870
The people living in this town...

00:00:11.870 --> 00:00:15.920
...were able to use this mysterious power once in their lifetime.

00:00:17.230 --> 00:00:19.450
The people believed in its existence...

00:00:19.770 --> 00:00:24.510
...and treasured it as a one-time present to their loved ones.

00:00:26.960 --> 00:00:28.130
Right now...

00:00:28.800 --> 00:00:29.460
...I have...

00:00:30.960 --> 00:00:31.990
...erased that Gift.

00:00:48.250 --> 00:00:52.170
tomodachi ni mo ienakatta

00:00:53.350 --> 00:00:57.500
omoi wo tojikometa mama no

00:00:58.670 --> 00:01:02.590
kokoro no naka mahou no furuutsu

00:01:03.720 --> 00:01:07.560
tabereba tsutawaru... nante ne

00:01:08.810 --> 00:01:13.170
kyoushitsu de matteita no, mada

00:01:14.070 --> 00:01:18.170
guuzen da to iiwake shiteru

00:01:18.410 --> 00:01:23.760
sono egao wa tabun dareka no mono

00:01:23.760 --> 00:01:29.220
yume ga watashi no negai wo kanaeru nara

00:01:29.220 --> 00:01:34.170
sotto agetai purezento yo

00:01:34.170 --> 00:01:39.340
anata no niji shiawase ni todoku

00:01:39.340 --> 00:01:44.300
hashi e to kaeru wa te wo futte ne

00:01:44.510 --> 00:01:49.580
ii no ii no

00:01:49.580 --> 00:01:54.930
mitsumeteitai dake nano...

00:02:07.100 --> 00:02:13.070
<i>The Eternal Rainbow</i>

00:02:37.280 --> 00:02:38.090
Riko...

00:02:41.280 --> 00:02:42.070
Riko?

00:02:43.560 --> 00:02:44.980
Wake up, Riko!

00:02:44.980 --> 00:02:45.770
Riko!

00:02:49.770 --> 00:02:50.930
Hey, Riko!

00:02:50.930 --> 00:02:52.750
Can you tell who I am?

00:02:52.750 --> 00:02:54.570
Onii-chan...?

00:02:55.530 --> 00:02:56.380
Riko!

00:03:00.450 --> 00:03:03.170
W-What are you doing, Onii-chan!?

00:03:03.170 --> 00:03:04.950
Sneaking into your little sister's room at night!?

00:03:05.250 --> 00:03:06.430
Can you tell?

00:03:07.260 --> 00:03:08.250
You remembered, didn't you?

00:03:08.880 --> 00:03:10.410
W-What?

00:03:10.410 --> 00:03:11.700
What's wrong, Onii-cha—

00:03:13.300 --> 00:03:14.380
I...

00:03:14.750 --> 00:03:16.220
Fukamine...

00:03:16.220 --> 00:03:17.630
Fukamine Riko.

00:03:17.630 --> 00:03:20.180
You're my little sister from now on!

00:03:20.180 --> 00:03:21.490
Little sister...?

00:03:22.160 --> 00:03:25.140
That's why you should call me "Onii-chan!"

00:03:25.140 --> 00:03:27.530
Let's go see the rainbow again here sometime.

00:03:27.530 --> 00:03:29.600
I'll take you along.

00:03:31.730 --> 00:03:32.810
Farewell...

00:03:37.900 --> 00:03:38.640
Riko...

00:03:39.590 --> 00:03:40.900
I love you.

00:03:43.480 --> 00:03:44.610
I...

00:03:45.920 --> 00:03:48.620
I love you too.

00:03:51.350 --> 00:03:52.450
I remember.

00:03:53.420 --> 00:03:55.960
I remember everything.

00:03:55.960 --> 00:03:58.600
I remember...

00:03:59.210 --> 00:04:00.130
...everything about you!

00:04:00.130 --> 00:04:01.260
Riko...

00:04:01.260 --> 00:04:02.030
Onii-chan!

00:04:14.810 --> 00:04:17.990
Will Kirinon come to school tomorrow?

00:04:17.990 --> 00:04:18.940
Yes.

00:04:18.940 --> 00:04:19.820
I am sure she will.

00:04:19.820 --> 00:04:22.350
The rainbow's disappeared.

00:04:22.350 --> 00:04:23.600
Good riddance.

00:04:25.260 --> 00:04:27.370
Time to work!

00:04:27.370 --> 00:04:29.020
The papers are piling up!

00:04:29.020 --> 00:04:30.130
They're pilin' up!

00:04:30.130 --> 00:04:31.330
They are piling up!

00:04:31.330 --> 00:04:33.830
Auau...

00:04:33.830 --> 00:04:35.660
What could have happened?

00:04:35.660 --> 00:04:37.680
Let's start practicing.

00:04:38.130 --> 00:04:40.270
I will be your sparring partner today.

00:04:40.270 --> 00:04:41.240
Really!?

00:04:41.240 --> 00:04:43.280
All right!

00:04:46.890 --> 00:04:48.470
Oh boy...

00:04:49.470 --> 00:04:51.170
Unemployed at my age?

00:04:54.630 --> 00:04:56.100
Delicious!

00:04:57.060 --> 00:04:59.010
Was this for the best?

00:04:59.010 --> 00:05:00.000
Yeah.

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:01.860
I was able to save you.

00:05:01.860 --> 00:05:03.570
I am satisfied with that.

00:05:03.570 --> 00:05:04.430
But...

00:05:05.030 --> 00:05:06.560
I finally understood.

00:05:06.560 --> 00:05:07.710
The meaning of Gift.

00:05:09.160 --> 00:05:10.450
I saw it.

00:05:10.930 --> 00:05:13.290
The day that Mom created Gift.

00:05:13.790 --> 00:05:17.290
<i>April 15th</i>

00:05:17.290 --> 00:05:18.090
Yes!

00:05:18.090 --> 00:05:19.430
That's a good boy!

00:05:19.430 --> 00:05:21.130
Isn't this great, Haru-san?

00:05:21.130 --> 00:05:22.400
Yes.

00:05:22.400 --> 00:05:24.520
I thought I'd never be able to anymore...

00:05:25.000 --> 00:05:27.630
But I'm glad I got to hold him in the end.

00:05:29.460 --> 00:05:33.280
It's okay to bring him to your hospital room now.

00:05:33.280 --> 00:05:34.640
Hold him as long as you want.

00:05:34.980 --> 00:05:36.260
Well...

00:05:36.260 --> 00:05:39.810
Could I take him up to the roof as well?

00:05:40.480 --> 00:05:41.550
Right now?

00:05:41.550 --> 00:05:42.570
Yes.

00:05:42.570 --> 00:05:45.070
Just me and Haruhiko.

00:05:45.070 --> 00:05:46.540
I don't know if that's...

00:05:46.540 --> 00:05:48.540
You can do that later, can't you?

00:05:48.540 --> 00:05:51.110
I want to show Haruhiko the rainbow.

00:05:51.110 --> 00:05:52.980
Only for a little while.

00:05:52.980 --> 00:05:54.040
Please.

00:05:59.370 --> 00:06:01.330
A beautiful rainbow, isn't it?

00:06:05.840 --> 00:06:07.850
Hey, Haruhiko.

00:06:07.850 --> 00:06:11.070
Mama has a magical ability.

00:06:11.070 --> 00:06:13.740
You could say I'm a magician.

00:06:14.770 --> 00:06:18.220
There have been times when I hated having this power.

00:06:19.100 --> 00:06:20.350
But not anymore.

00:06:20.910 --> 00:06:22.010
Because...

00:06:22.010 --> 00:06:25.360
...it allows me to give you a wonderful present.

00:06:26.410 --> 00:06:28.360
It is called Gift.

00:06:28.760 --> 00:06:30.340
This power...

00:06:30.340 --> 00:06:34.370
...will show you the various bonds between people.

00:06:35.010 --> 00:06:36.730
Happiness and smiles...

00:06:36.730 --> 00:06:38.270
Sadness and tears...

00:06:39.000 --> 00:06:42.470
The most important aspects of life.

00:06:43.880 --> 00:06:45.960
Papa is a good person...

00:06:45.960 --> 00:06:48.880
...but he can be so out of touch with the world...

00:06:49.260 --> 00:06:51.150
That is why I will give you Gift.

00:06:52.700 --> 00:06:56.930
Please forgive Mama for not being able to raise you.

00:06:59.030 --> 00:07:00.350
Thank you.

00:07:00.350 --> 00:07:01.480
You are so kind.

00:07:03.570 --> 00:07:05.760
Gift is Mama herself.

00:07:06.610 --> 00:07:08.710
I will always watch over you.

00:07:09.220 --> 00:07:10.990
Until you are grown up...

00:07:11.620 --> 00:07:15.990
...and capable of chasing that rainbow on your own.

00:07:15.990 --> 00:07:17.390
One day...

00:07:17.390 --> 00:07:20.020
...you will find a person precious to you as well.

00:07:21.730 --> 00:07:23.950
A person more precious to you than anything else in the world.

00:07:23.950 --> 00:07:25.170
<i>Mom...</i>

00:07:25.170 --> 00:07:27.540
Together... with that person...

00:07:30.030 --> 00:07:31.770
Mother already knew.

00:07:32.430 --> 00:07:35.480
That I would one day erase Gift.

00:07:35.480 --> 00:07:36.930
So that's how it was...

00:07:36.930 --> 00:07:39.120
I think she was waiting...

00:07:39.630 --> 00:07:41.940
...for the day I would be able to stand on my own feet.

00:07:42.900 --> 00:07:44.320
Onii-chan...

00:07:44.320 --> 00:07:47.890
It's all thanks to you that I was able to reach this point.

00:07:47.890 --> 00:07:49.610
R-Really?

00:07:49.610 --> 00:07:50.520
Yeah!

00:07:50.520 --> 00:07:52.020
Please stick with me from now on as well!

00:07:52.020 --> 00:07:53.260
Same here!

00:07:55.550 --> 00:07:56.620
Onii-chan...

00:07:58.450 --> 00:08:00.560
Don't worry about it.

00:08:00.560 --> 00:08:02.610
Still, I can't leave her like this.

00:08:02.610 --> 00:08:03.750
You understand, right?

00:08:03.750 --> 00:08:04.430
Yeah.

00:08:05.360 --> 00:08:09.880
Kirino is a precious childhood friend to the both of us.

00:08:09.880 --> 00:08:12.210
Can you help her?

00:08:12.210 --> 00:08:12.910
Yeah.

00:08:13.630 --> 00:08:16.600
I'm the one who drove her into this predicament.

00:08:16.600 --> 00:08:20.310
I didn't realize how she felt back then.

00:08:20.310 --> 00:08:21.500
But...

00:08:21.500 --> 00:08:24.720
...thinking about things that I should have done back then...

00:08:24.720 --> 00:08:26.310
...won't bring back the past.

00:08:26.700 --> 00:08:30.360
That would be impossible even with a Gift.

00:08:31.740 --> 00:08:32.370
However...

00:08:33.090 --> 00:08:35.200
...it is possible to start anew.

00:08:36.060 --> 00:08:37.210
I'm sure it is.

00:08:47.470 --> 00:08:48.210
Kirino.

00:08:51.660 --> 00:08:52.960
Sorry...

00:08:52.960 --> 00:08:54.370
...for barging in like this.

00:08:54.370 --> 00:08:57.610
A sky without a rainbow looks kinda strange.

00:08:59.920 --> 00:09:02.530
To think you would erase Gift...

00:09:03.670 --> 00:09:05.580
Was this for Riko-chan's sake?

00:09:05.580 --> 00:09:06.520
Yeah...

00:09:07.790 --> 00:09:09.010
I see...

00:09:09.010 --> 00:09:10.600
And for your sake as well.

00:09:10.600 --> 00:09:11.740
My sake?

00:09:14.020 --> 00:09:15.970
Just forget it.

00:09:15.970 --> 00:09:17.760
Forget what?

00:09:17.760 --> 00:09:19.960
Because there's no helping it.

00:09:20.660 --> 00:09:22.820
I'm sure you hate me right now.

00:09:22.820 --> 00:09:25.500
After what I did to Riko-chan...

00:09:25.500 --> 00:09:27.210
No...

00:09:27.210 --> 00:09:29.930
But I'm relieved.

00:09:29.930 --> 00:09:33.410
That you were able to give Riko-chan back her precious memories.

00:09:33.970 --> 00:09:35.880
I truly feel that way.

00:09:35.880 --> 00:09:37.080
Kirino...

00:09:37.080 --> 00:09:39.260
I'm sorry, Haruhiko-kun...

00:09:41.340 --> 00:09:42.190
Kirino.

00:09:42.910 --> 00:09:45.070
I have a request.

00:09:45.070 --> 00:09:46.270
A request?

00:09:46.270 --> 00:09:48.770
Let me listen to you play the piano.

00:09:56.150 --> 00:09:57.230
Piano?

00:09:57.810 --> 00:09:58.990
Me?

00:09:58.990 --> 00:10:00.020
Yeah.

00:10:00.020 --> 00:10:03.630
I want you to play the piano piece that I didn't get to listen to that day.

00:10:05.450 --> 00:10:07.540
Please, Kirino.

00:10:08.000 --> 00:10:09.330
Why...

00:10:09.870 --> 00:10:11.330
...do you want that?

00:10:11.330 --> 00:10:12.940
I want to start over.

00:10:12.940 --> 00:10:15.230
You're saying that now...?

00:10:15.710 --> 00:10:18.060
I apologize for breaking the promise.

00:10:18.060 --> 00:10:21.450
Though I know apologies won't make up for it...

00:10:22.020 --> 00:10:24.910
I couldn't keep my head straight back then.

00:10:24.910 --> 00:10:26.140
No!

00:10:26.140 --> 00:10:29.060
It won't matter how many excuses I make.

00:10:29.060 --> 00:10:29.940
I just...

00:10:30.660 --> 00:10:34.730
...want to redo the time I couldn't spend with you due to my own mistakes.

00:10:34.730 --> 00:10:36.440
Once more, renewed.

00:10:37.950 --> 00:10:41.110
That's why I want to hear you play the piano.

00:10:41.110 --> 00:10:42.470
Please, Kirino.

00:10:43.140 --> 00:10:44.180
It's impossible.

00:10:44.180 --> 00:10:45.090
Kirino!

00:10:45.090 --> 00:10:46.950
It's impossible... I can't do it!

00:10:47.530 --> 00:10:48.460
Why not?

00:10:48.910 --> 00:10:50.430
I told you, didn't I?

00:10:50.430 --> 00:10:53.680
I haven't been able to play since that day.

00:10:53.680 --> 00:10:55.240
No matter how hard I tried.

00:10:56.200 --> 00:10:59.470
I just can't play a piece until the end.

00:11:01.750 --> 00:11:05.590
I'm glad about what you've said, but...

00:11:06.340 --> 00:11:07.440
...I'm sorry.

00:11:13.310 --> 00:11:15.850
We can no longer go back.

00:11:15.850 --> 00:11:17.260
That's not true.

00:11:18.530 --> 00:11:20.320
We can go back.

00:11:27.830 --> 00:11:30.040
That's your...

00:11:31.790 --> 00:11:33.000
Why?

00:11:33.590 --> 00:11:34.790
That time...

00:11:36.630 --> 00:11:37.880
How could I ever go!?

00:11:38.270 --> 00:11:39.440
I...

00:11:39.440 --> 00:11:41.430
...was certain that...

00:11:41.430 --> 00:11:42.970
I haven't thrown it away.

00:11:43.480 --> 00:11:45.370
How could I ever do that?

00:11:47.230 --> 00:11:50.410
I really don't feel like going on that school picnic tomorrow...

00:11:50.410 --> 00:11:52.620
I'm the only one with a convenience store lunch.

00:11:53.410 --> 00:11:54.520
Why?

00:11:55.150 --> 00:11:56.980
My father is too busy.

00:11:58.620 --> 00:12:00.180
I don't wanna go.

00:12:00.180 --> 00:12:03.490
I'm sure everyone else has a delicious lunch made by their mothers...

00:12:04.980 --> 00:12:07.990
Want me to make you one?

00:12:08.580 --> 00:12:09.820
You?

00:12:09.820 --> 00:12:12.280
I can at least make rice balls.

00:12:12.280 --> 00:12:14.000
That's okay, right?

00:12:14.300 --> 00:12:15.500
Really!?

00:12:15.500 --> 00:12:17.000
Yeah!

00:12:17.000 --> 00:12:19.320
Even so, I broke it off.

00:12:20.090 --> 00:12:21.770
I'm sorry, Kirino.

00:12:23.350 --> 00:12:26.760
But it was stupid to leave it broken like this.

00:12:31.680 --> 00:12:33.940
Broken strings should just be retied.

00:12:35.150 --> 00:12:36.670
Haruhiko-kun...

00:12:39.970 --> 00:12:40.860
Kirino.

00:12:46.620 --> 00:12:48.810
Please let me listen to you play the piano.

00:12:50.910 --> 00:12:53.000
This time, no matter what happens...

00:12:53.000 --> 00:12:55.770
...I will definitely listen until the end.

00:12:55.770 --> 00:12:56.830
I promise.

00:12:57.810 --> 00:12:58.630
But...

00:13:00.240 --> 00:13:02.020
You can do it.

00:13:02.020 --> 00:13:03.050
I'm sure of it.

00:13:03.490 --> 00:13:05.050
Haruhiko-kun...

00:13:18.900 --> 00:13:20.280
And that's that.

00:13:21.160 --> 00:13:22.460
See you later.

00:13:22.460 --> 00:13:23.760
I'll be looking forward to it.

00:13:23.760 --> 00:13:24.900
W-Wait!

00:13:26.570 --> 00:13:29.810
Does Riko-chan know about this...?

00:13:29.810 --> 00:13:31.030
She does.

00:13:31.030 --> 00:13:32.430
And she's waiting...

00:13:32.870 --> 00:13:35.080
...for a chance to make amends with you.

00:13:42.090 --> 00:13:45.490
It's good to see you up and about again.

00:13:45.490 --> 00:13:46.710
Really!

00:13:46.710 --> 00:13:48.090
We were worried!

00:13:48.090 --> 00:13:49.330
Sorry.

00:13:49.330 --> 00:13:50.600
I'm fine now.

00:13:50.600 --> 00:13:53.580
Next time, please tell us when something happens.

00:13:54.060 --> 00:13:55.310
We will be there for you.

00:13:56.330 --> 00:13:57.590
Thanks.

00:13:57.590 --> 00:13:58.810
Fukamine-san.

00:13:58.810 --> 00:14:01.330
Are you back in shape?

00:14:01.330 --> 00:14:02.380
Yes.

00:14:02.380 --> 00:14:04.820
I'm sorry to make you worry.

00:14:06.700 --> 00:14:07.820
Oh?

00:14:07.820 --> 00:14:11.330
Somehow, it feels like you've grown a size...

00:14:12.180 --> 00:14:14.420
Such an unfortunate matter.

00:14:16.370 --> 00:14:19.250
A young man and woman under the same roof...

00:14:21.320 --> 00:14:23.730
You have the wrong idea...

00:14:24.550 --> 00:14:25.870
Where's Kirinon?

00:14:25.870 --> 00:14:27.170
Isn't she with you?

00:14:27.910 --> 00:14:29.660
She won't be here yet today.

00:14:30.830 --> 00:14:33.850
Is she still not feeling well?

00:14:33.850 --> 00:14:35.720
No need to worry.

00:14:35.720 --> 00:14:37.030
It's okay!

00:14:37.030 --> 00:14:38.850
I will hold my promise with all of you.

00:14:43.640 --> 00:14:45.860
<i>Let me listen to you play the piano.</i>

00:14:45.860 --> 00:14:47.780
<i>You can do it.</i>

00:14:47.780 --> 00:14:48.860
<i>I'm sure you can.</i>

00:14:49.800 --> 00:14:51.350
Haruhiko-kun...

00:15:04.360 --> 00:15:08.880
Gift's disappearance seems to have caused quite an uproar in town.

00:15:08.880 --> 00:15:10.590
I see.

00:15:10.590 --> 00:15:12.690
I wonder why it disappeared?

00:15:12.690 --> 00:15:14.180
Beats me.

00:15:14.180 --> 00:15:17.890
No clue who did it, but aren't you happy about it?

00:15:17.890 --> 00:15:19.630
I wonder...

00:15:19.630 --> 00:15:22.870
It does feel a bit desolate now that it's gone.

00:15:26.350 --> 00:15:28.580
Well, it's just temporary anyway.

00:15:28.580 --> 00:15:31.050
I'll be so busy every day I'll soon forget.

00:15:32.160 --> 00:15:33.730
That's how I know you.

00:15:35.990 --> 00:15:38.410
Those were some good vibes between you and Yajima.

00:15:38.730 --> 00:15:39.920
Stop it!

00:15:39.920 --> 00:15:41.220
Just kidding.

00:15:41.220 --> 00:15:45.260
Anyway, care to tell me how you erased Gift?

00:15:45.260 --> 00:15:47.450
An explanation both logical and scientific, please.

00:15:47.450 --> 00:15:49.340
That's an impossible request.

00:15:49.620 --> 00:15:51.960
Everything has been resolved.

00:15:51.960 --> 00:15:54.760
I have plenty of time to listen to you.

00:15:54.760 --> 00:15:55.630
Not yet.

00:15:55.630 --> 00:15:56.350
Huh?

00:15:59.070 --> 00:16:00.670
Not everything has been resolved yet.

00:16:20.930 --> 00:16:21.960
Kirino?

00:16:28.140 --> 00:16:29.730
Haruhiko-kun...

00:16:29.730 --> 00:16:31.670
Will you listen to me play the piano?

00:16:32.860 --> 00:16:33.840
Sure.

00:16:33.840 --> 00:16:36.720
But I have a favor to ask of you.

00:16:36.720 --> 00:16:37.850
What is it?

00:16:37.850 --> 00:16:39.670
I want you to cheer me on...

00:16:40.190 --> 00:16:44.050
...so that I can play until the end.

00:16:44.800 --> 00:16:45.970
Of course.

00:16:45.970 --> 00:16:47.220
I'll cheer you on!

00:16:47.220 --> 00:16:48.110
I promise.

00:16:48.960 --> 00:16:51.610
Also, one more thing.

00:16:52.800 --> 00:16:55.360
Bring Riko-chan along.

00:17:02.040 --> 00:17:03.170
Kirino-chan...

00:17:03.910 --> 00:17:06.420
Thanks for coming.

00:17:06.420 --> 00:17:07.440
Err...

00:17:07.440 --> 00:17:09.620
I, umm...

00:17:09.620 --> 00:17:11.480
I wanted you to hear it.

00:17:11.480 --> 00:17:14.190
Both you and Haruhiko-kun together.

00:17:14.190 --> 00:17:15.180
Kirino-chan...

00:17:18.770 --> 00:17:20.100
Okay!

00:17:20.100 --> 00:17:21.890
Do your best, Kirino-chan!

00:17:29.730 --> 00:17:31.260
Kirino...

00:17:31.260 --> 00:17:32.400
Do your best.

00:18:02.350 --> 00:18:03.890
Go for it, Kirino!

00:18:03.890 --> 00:18:05.560
Do your best, Kirino-chan!

00:18:33.420 --> 00:18:35.510
Kirino, you can do it!

00:18:54.010 --> 00:18:54.850
Kirino!

00:18:54.850 --> 00:18:55.820
Kirino-chan!

00:19:16.190 --> 00:19:17.380
Kirino-chan!

00:19:17.380 --> 00:19:18.620
That was great!

00:19:18.620 --> 00:19:21.460
That was really great, Kirino-chan!

00:19:21.460 --> 00:19:23.090
Really great!

00:19:23.090 --> 00:19:24.440
Riko-chan...

00:19:24.440 --> 00:19:25.630
Thanks.

00:19:25.630 --> 00:19:26.640
Kirino.

00:19:26.640 --> 00:19:27.810
That was wonderful!

00:19:28.730 --> 00:19:31.690
Thanks, Haruhiko-kun.

00:19:31.690 --> 00:19:33.780
Good for you, Kirino.

00:19:34.190 --> 00:19:35.820
Haruhiko-kun...

00:19:41.770 --> 00:19:43.570
Thanks, Kirino.

00:19:48.240 --> 00:19:49.640
S-Sorry!

00:19:49.640 --> 00:19:51.080
Riko-chan, I just...

00:19:53.790 --> 00:19:59.170
I feel like I've finally moved on, thanks to Haruhiko-kun.

00:19:59.170 --> 00:20:02.680
I feel really happy right now.

00:20:02.680 --> 00:20:04.900
That's great, Kirino-chan.

00:20:04.900 --> 00:20:09.300
So now it's your turn to make Haruhiko-kun happy, Riko-chan.

00:20:10.180 --> 00:20:11.690
Are you sure?

00:20:11.690 --> 00:20:12.770
Yes!

00:20:12.770 --> 00:20:17.770
Because Haruhiko-kun needs you to be able to move on.

00:20:17.770 --> 00:20:18.690
Kirino-chan...

00:20:18.690 --> 00:20:20.690
Take good care of Haruhiko-kun!

00:20:20.690 --> 00:20:21.480
Okay.

00:20:21.480 --> 00:20:22.550
And me as well!

00:20:22.550 --> 00:20:24.210
Okay!

00:20:24.210 --> 00:20:26.580
Haruhiko-kun too, okay?

00:20:26.580 --> 00:20:27.680
Yeah.

00:20:27.680 --> 00:20:30.100
Let's all get along from now on!

00:20:30.100 --> 00:20:31.580
Right, Kirino?

00:20:31.580 --> 00:20:32.570
Yeah!

00:20:45.340 --> 00:20:47.260
We came here again.

00:20:47.260 --> 00:20:48.160
Yeah.

00:20:48.160 --> 00:20:49.950
We promised, right?

00:20:49.950 --> 00:20:52.280
To see the rainbow here again.

00:20:53.500 --> 00:20:54.630
But...

00:20:57.360 --> 00:20:59.900
We can always come back to see one, Riko.

00:20:59.900 --> 00:21:01.950
We'll be together forever, right?

00:21:03.360 --> 00:21:06.700
Riko, we'll be together forever, right?

00:21:08.280 --> 00:21:09.490
Yeah!

00:21:09.490 --> 00:21:11.200
We'll always be together!

00:21:11.200 --> 00:21:12.030
Yeah.

00:21:22.210 --> 00:21:23.490
<i>Haruhiko.</i>

00:21:23.490 --> 00:21:25.670
<i>Go chase the rainbow.</i>

00:21:25.670 --> 00:21:29.920
<i>On your own feet, with the person most dear to you.</i>

00:21:29.920 --> 00:21:31.180
<i>Whenever...</i>

00:21:31.180 --> 00:21:32.220
<i>Wherever...</i>

00:21:32.580 --> 00:21:33.550
<i>Yeah.</i>

00:21:33.550 --> 00:21:35.230
<i>Of course, Mom.</i>

00:21:35.710 --> 00:21:36.580
Riko.

00:21:37.060 --> 00:21:40.230
Let's go chase the rainbow together.

00:21:40.230 --> 00:21:41.160
Okay.

00:21:44.650 --> 00:21:49.260
Precious gifts can be given even without relying on a miraculous power.

00:21:51.060 --> 00:21:53.570
As long as you have a person more precious to you than anyone else...

00:22:03.930 --> 00:22:05.260
Mama...

00:22:06.120 --> 00:22:08.290
As long as you have a precious person you want to protect...

00:22:17.190 --> 00:22:19.150
As long as you have a precious family...

00:22:28.930 --> 00:22:30.780
As long as you have feelings to bring across...

00:22:43.450 --> 00:22:44.620
Perfect.

00:22:44.620 --> 00:22:45.460
It's flawless.

00:22:46.470 --> 00:22:48.100
As long as you never give up...

00:23:01.640 --> 00:23:04.370
As long as you don't forget those feelings.

00:23:11.710 --> 00:23:13.680
We can give gifts at any time.

00:23:14.430 --> 00:23:16.510
As long as the two of us are together.

00:23:16.510 --> 00:23:17.790
Yeah.

00:23:17.790 --> 00:23:18.810
Riko...
